## 🔵 **🧠 01. PROJECT OVERVIEW**

An AI-powered handwritten digit recognition application built using **Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN)**, **TensorFlow**, and **Streamlit**.

The application recognizes handwritten digits from **0 to 9** using an interactive drawing canvas and provides prediction confidence scores.

## 🟣 **✨ 02. KEY FEATURES**

| Feature | Description |
|:---|:---|
| ✍️ **Interactive Canvas** | Draw handwritten digits |
| ⚡ **Real-Time Prediction** | Instant digit recognition |
| 🎯 **Confidence Score** | Prediction confidence |
| 📊 **Probability Chart** | Visualize all 10 digit probabilities |
| 🖼️ **Image Processing** | Preview processed images |
| 🌐 **Live Deployment** | Access the application online |

## 🟢 **🏆 03. MODEL PERFORMANCE**

### **99.1% TEST ACCURACY**

| 📌 Metric | 📊 Result |
|:---|:---|
| **Dataset** | MNIST |
| **Training Images** | 60,000 |
| **Testing Images** | 10,000 |
| **Image Dimensions** | 28 × 28 Pixels |
| **Architecture** | CNN |
| **Test Accuracy** | **99.1%** |

*Accuracy measured on the MNIST test dataset.*

## 🟠 **🛠️ 04. TECHNOLOGY STACK**

- 🐍 **Python** — Programming
- 🧠 **TensorFlow / Keras** — Deep Learning
- 🔢 **NumPy** — Numerical Computing
- 👁️ **OpenCV** — Image Processing
- 🌐 **Streamlit** — Web Application
- ✏️ **Drawable Canvas** — User Input

## 🔴 **🏗️ 05. CNN MODEL ARCHITECTURE**

**Convolutional Neural Network Workflow**

```text
       INPUT IMAGE (28 × 28 × 1)
                  |
                  v
       CONV2D (32 FILTERS, ReLU)
                  |
                  v
          MAX POOLING (2 × 2)
                  |
                  v
       CONV2D (64 FILTERS, ReLU)
                  |
                  v
          MAX POOLING (2 × 2)
                  |
                  v
             FLATTEN
                  |
                  v
       DENSE (128 NEURONS, ReLU)
                  |
                  v
       OUTPUT (10 NEURONS, SOFTMAX)
                  |
                  v
          PREDICTED DIGIT (0–9)
```

### ⚙️ **Training Configuration**

| Parameter | Configuration |
|:---|:---|
| **Optimizer** | Adam |
| **Loss Function** | Sparse Categorical Crossentropy |
| **Epochs** | 5 |
| **Batch Size** | 64 |
| **Validation Split** | 10% |

